subckt UBVCO (VDD VSS gs Vc Vte ibg450u_ic inp inn vs)
C1 (inn Vc) capacitor c=1p
C2 (inp Vc) capacitor c=1p
C3 (inn Vte) capacitor c=1p
C4 (inp Vte) capacitor c=1p
L1 (inn net0) inductor l=1n
L2 (net0 inp) inductor l=1n
M1 (inp inn net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (inn inp net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net1 ibg450u_ic gs VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (ibg450u_ic ibg450u_ic gs gs) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R1 (vs net0) resistor r=1k
